		"Name": "Who raided the food supply?",
                             "Details": "Dinner in the mess hall: You stand to address the assembled crew. \r\n\r\n\"As some of you may already know, we have had our ups and downs with the food supply. However, today I need to congratulate Executive Officer Darius on coming through and learning about proper food management.\" Of course, this announcement is met with groans and jeers from the assembled crew. \r\n\"Now, now! Hold on a moment.\" Thankfully, the crew calms down a bit. \r\n\"In the past few food-order cycles, Darius has been attentive and conservative in his attempts to maximize our profit in the food department. What you all have yet to realize is that those weird new bonus food supplies you were all attributing to me are from Darius.\" \r\n A gasp echoes from the suddenly quiet assembly of crew. \r\n\"Yes, Darius was quietly providing those bonuses of your preferred foods solely by paying attention to what you all ate and listening to you all lament not having food X.\"",
